16. TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

ISSUE: NAVBAR NOT SHOWING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Possible Cause:
Component not imported.

Check:

import NavBar from './components/NavBar';

And:

<NavBar />


ISSUE: NAVBAR APPEARS IN THE MIDDLE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Possible Cause:
Existing CSS is centering the page.

Check styles such as:

place-items: center;

Remove or modify them if they are affecting the layout.


ISSUE: BOOTSTRAP STYLES NOT WORKING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Possible Cause:
Bootstrap CSS is not installed or imported.

Verify your Bootstrap setup.


ISSUE: HAMBURGER MENU DOES NOT WORK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Possible Cause:
Bootstrap's JavaScript functionality is not available.

The responsive collapse/toggler needs the required Bootstrap JavaScript,
not only the Bootstrap CSS.


ISSUE: IMPORT ERROR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Possible Cause:
Incorrect path or filename.

Verify:

src/
  components/
    NavBar.jsx
  App.jsx

Import:

import NavBar from './components/NavBar';


